the ability to walk in and have

00:35:32.670 --> 00:35:35.350
a kiosk just in a
Marriott down the street,

00:35:35.350 --> 00:35:36.970
for example so that--

00:35:36.970 --> 00:35:38.380
what's that-- I don't even know.

00:35:38.380 --> 00:35:40.463
I think it's the Enterprise
car commercial, right,

00:35:40.463 --> 00:35:42.060
where the guy
says, well, I don't

00:35:42.060 --> 00:35:43.870
