unless I want to.

00:35:43.870 --> 00:35:45.315
And I don't want to.

00:35:45.315 --> 00:35:46.690
I'm kind of that
guy, by the way.

00:35:46.690 --> 00:35:47.190
[LAUGHS]

00:35:47.190 --> 00:35:49.980
So the idea to be able to
just interact with the device

00:35:49.980 --> 00:35:52.260
and get what you want is
kind of appealing to me.

00:35:52.260 --> 00:35:55.020
So these are the
types of things that

00:35:55.020 --> 00:35:57.620
even on something as simple
as you can't find someone

00:35:57.620 --> 00:35:59.220
to take your order
or talk to you,

00:35:59.220 --> 00:36:02.190
can lead to this inspiration
that allows you to focus

00:36:02.190 --> 00:36:04.740
