00:36:14.270 --> 00:36:16.720
All of these things exist
in the Android scenario.

00:36:16.720 --> 00:36:18.778
These are devices
that you can use.

00:36:18.778 --> 00:36:20.070
You can buy them off the shelf.

00:36:20.070 --> 00:36:23.280
There are companies that will
work with you to private label

00:36:23.280 --> 00:36:26.310
